STOCK 4 6 0.00 0.00 0.00 2600.00 0.00 30.00
CELL 4 7 pipe SN 3 E 1 0.00
CELL 4 8 pipe SN 3 E 1 0.00
CELL 4 9 drop N 3 S 1 100.00
BUCKET 321.00 716.00 150.00 90.00
ON 2
LABEL 24.00 400.00 COMPRESSOR CONTROL & AIR MOTOR\nPS1 closes below 6 bar: KM1 runs C1\nuntil 8 bar. The air motor AM1 drives\nBelt01; FC1 (wheel) sets its speed.
